  "_ambiguities": [
    "Scroll-to-question on click is NOT asserted: no op reads scroll position; the click only checks the item is clickable.",
    "Contents item text equals the question title is only checked through the titles appearing on the page (expect_text), which is weak.",
    "Fixed position and \"cannot cover question content\" are checked only via expect_all_clickable on design with 5 questions.",
    "Reordering is asserted only on the preview page (question order via first fieldset id = name). The spec does not say whether preview supports drag reorder, so this may be too strict; design-page reorder cannot be checked because design names are random.",
    "Contents items are assumed to be the only children of .contents for the nth-child selectors.",
